   "text": "Return-to-site inspection robots in hazardous, secure or GPS-denied\nfacilities. We demonstrate on a Kobuki ground robot with a Kinect RGB-D\ncamera.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Return-to-site inspection robots in hazardous, secure or GPS-denied\nfacilities. We demonstrate on a Kobuki ground robot with a Kinect RGB-D\ncamera.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
